npc npc-sage
name: Sage
title: Safety and society teacher
field: safety-waste-society

bio:
    I'm Sage. I teach how nuclear power is kept safe, what happens to waste, and the choices a society makes. I like to look at both sides before I decide. I'll show you both, and then it's your call.

